<title>USA: Xybernaut completes $3 mln placement.</title>
<headline>Xybernaut completes $3 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xybernaut Corp said Tuesday it completed a $3 million private placement of preferred stock with institutional investors managed by Liberty View Capital Management Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the preferred stock placement provides it with the possibility of raising capital at a premium above the current stock price.</p>
<p>Xybernaut is a computer company.</p>
